<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 151 0 R
/E (The International Spanish Academy is a program-wide plan for promoting additive bilingualism and biliteracy that takes home language profiles into consideration. The International Spanish Academy \(ISA\) helps Southampton students achieve major world language milestones approximately two years earlier than students in a traditional World Language sequence. ISA students complete Checkpoint A in Grade 6 compared with the typical completion by Grade 8, and complete Checkpoint B in Grade 8 compared with the typical completion by Grade 10. In addition, many ISA students have the opportunity to earn the internationally recognized DELE certification while still in middle school, demonstrating advanced Spanish proficiency at an age when most students are still working toward Checkpoint B.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [1]
>>
